  "reasoning": "The defendant organized multiple companies and, by falsely promising high returns, solicited funds from the public for non‑existent projects. The funds were not used for the stated purposes and could not be returned, constituting the use of fraudulent methods to raise money from the public. Under Chinese criminal law this conduct is defined as the crime of illegal fundraising (非法集资罪). No other distinct crimes are described in the facts.",
